# Test: OSPFv2 inter-AS TE LSA (RFC 5392 Opaque type 6, spec-ospf-ext-2).
#
# VALIDATES: a configured inter-as link with scope=as originates a Type-11 (AS-wide) opaque
# TE LSA, and a received inter-AS TE LSA (Remote AS 21, IPv4 ASBR ID 22, no Link ID) is
# parsed into the TED with its remote AS and ASBR.
# PREVENTS: inter-AS TE flooded at the wrong scope or an inter-AS body that never reaches the
# TED.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf -run TestOSPFTEInterASFunctional -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
